  lore: {
    about: "This enemy has a higher RES to Glacio DMG . A torpid snapping turtle in the frozen lake, carrying an ancient bell on its back. Some researchers once tried to transcribe the inscriptions on the bell, but accidentally disturbed the gargantuan Chelonian's dreams. When it awakens, a drawn-out toll will echo throughout the Gorges of Spirits.",
    undiscovered: "A Calamity Class Howler TD lying dormant in Gorges of Spirit. Due to its permanent inactivity, records of its behaviors are scarce.",
